WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.510
The first summer since I started
riding my Cub had arrived.

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.140
Final Exam for Math II

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:19.430
Reiko said that she wanted to do
something huge over summer vacation.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:24.650
There is something that I am
thinking of doing, as well.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:29.190
Something that since I have my Cub--
since I <i>found </i>my Cub,

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.530
I am thinking of doing, as well.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.950
Academic Affairs Office

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.930
School affairs assistant postings

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.910
Let's see...

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:47.250
You're the one who rides a Cub, as I
recall. What do you think about this one?

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.010
Document transport?

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:55.090
During summer vacation,
there is a joint training program going on

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:58.180
between our school and
Kofu Daiichi High, you see.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:01.470
We would have you shuttle papers
for that between here and there.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.230
It would primarily be two round trips,
morning and evening.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.810
The pay would be 2000 yen per round trip.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:11.070
Gasoline and various other expenses
would come out of that, though.

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:12.440
What do you think?

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:17.990
Episode 4

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:17.990
Super Cub

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:17.990
The Job

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.990
Please give me until
tomorrow to think about it.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:13.980
That's being a courier.

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:15.400
Courier?

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:18.240
Officially, you'd be a diplomatic envoy.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.950
The job is to directly deliver
secret diplomatic papers

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:23.070
that no one else can see.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:27.660
Nowadays, they even call small package
deliveries from express carriers that.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.370
Hmm...

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:32.250
So, are you going to take the job?

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:35.090
Mm-hmm, I'll give it a try.

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:36.750
"Koshu Chicken & Rice"

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:39.380
That explains it. I guess you're just
checking out the route, then?

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:45.140
I went as far as Kofu Station. The round
trip was just under an hour and a half.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:49.520
And that <i>ekiben </i>lunch is your trophy?
You haven't even been paid yet.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:52.140
Aren't you eating your chickens
before they're hatched?

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:58.690
Okay, you start tomorrow.
Oh, one other thing--

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:01.200
this <i>does </i>fall under school business,

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:04.450
so you'll have to wear your school
uniform while you're working.

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:07.330
I think my uniform might be
a little dangerous.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:11.080
I'll be on major roads
at a pretty good speed,

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:15.080
so if my skirt or whatever gets
caught up on anything, then riding--

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:18.050
Ah, that would leave
you exposed, wouldn't it?

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:20.800
Mm-hmm, that would be dangerous, huh?

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.260
Anyhow, please let me wear my gym clothes.

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.890
When do you start your job?

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:32.890
Tomorrow, after the exam block.

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:36.900
Well, good luck. I'm going to be
riding during the summer, too.

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.480
Where are you going?

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:44.700
Somewhere close, yet far away.

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:47.950
Be careful, okay?

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.160
Yeah.

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.390
620 km...

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:28.950
Um, I've ridden more than 100 km,
so I need an oil change, please.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:32.330
That happened sooner than I expected.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:41.880
I'm glad I noticed. I start a new job
tomorrow using my Cub.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.260
A job?

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:47.130
Ever since I bought my Cub,
I've had a number of expenses.

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:49.050
Hmm...

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:58.100
Change your oil at 100 km, and at 500 km,
then after that, at 1000 km.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:02.230
By that point, you should get
so that you can do it yourself.

00:06:02.230 --> 00:06:05.110
Where can I buy that?

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:09.320
Anywhere that sells engine oil.

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:12.450
Should I buy that kind of oil?

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:14.910
That is the best kind.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:23.960
500 yen.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:27.170
Huh? 500 yen is all?

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:30.300
It's my introductory service charge.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:32.300
Komeri Hardware 
& Green

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:32.300
Mukawa Store

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.880
"First day on the job"

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:16.620
Okay, go and deliver this.

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:20.790
Is there a time limit?

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:23.460
Just be back sometime before noon.

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:29.210
Once you've delivered our papers,
don't forget to pick up theirs, okay?

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:06.750
"Kofu City"

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:18.260
Kofu Daiichi Prefectural High School

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:23.730
Go straight through the quad
and it's right there.

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:25.810
Thank you very much.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:40.280
Faculty Room

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.670
Come in.

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.300
Over here.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:57.630
Glad you made it.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:10:00.800
Um, this is from Mukawa High School.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:03.970
Right. Indeed it is.

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:06.100
Well, okay then...

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:09.190
Oh, stay here until I check these papers.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:11.690
Oh, okay.

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:14.610
Ugh, so much writing here...

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:26.460
Yes! Attaway, attaway!

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:31.540
Fight! Nice one! Get that basket!

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.630
All right, okay.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:41.760
Here. Why not take a break before
you leave? I'll make some tea.

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:45.270
No, I have to get back to my school, so...

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:49.520
Oh, that's too bad. Well, be careful.

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:52.150
Right. Please excuse me.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:04.490
Wait up! Wait up! Wait up!

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:07.910
I forgot to give you the papers
to take back with you!

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:13.130
I'm sorry about that.
It just slipped my mind.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:20.880
No, I neglected to check, myself. I beg
your pardon. Now, if you'll excuse me...

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:38.150
Once summer vacation starts in earnest,
it will be two trips per day,

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:41.860
but this is all for today. There.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:46.700
Here, this is for you.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:48.790
Thank you very much.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.160
Okay... Oh?

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:16.960
I'm over 500 km.

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:24.940
Hmm... You're riding her gently.

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:27.700
Almost too gently.

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:38.920
Too gently, huh?

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:13.280
Oh!

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:15.120
Are you all right?!

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:20.540
This is not your lucky day, huh?
Here, use this.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:22.460
Thank you.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:33.890
There, okay. We don't have any papers
for you to take back today.

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:36.430
All right. Well, here.

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:40.390
I'm sure it's a summer shower.
You should wait here until it lets up.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.270
Oh...

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:45.360
All right. Thank you very much.

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:58.580
Um, are you an adviser for one
of the clubs, or something?

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:02.460
Ah, now that you mention it,
I never told you, did I?

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.210
The Literature Club.

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:07.920
Huh? Oh, I see.

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:47.670
{=0}Ladies'
Rain Wear

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:05.440
m 305 373 l 220 716 81 716 189 376

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:05.440
Happy

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:05.440
Drink

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:05.440
Shop

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:11.840
Take that.

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:34.690
Huh?

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:36.990
I'm over 1000 km!

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:46.620
"Idle the engine briefly
to warm up the oil."

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:55.340
"How to change the oil"

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:57.470
That must be it.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.550
Ouch...

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:55.130
"Last day on the job"

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:03.050
Here. Good work this
last month and a half.

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:07.300
Thank you very much.

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:18.110
Now that I've saved this much...

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:26.450
Hello?

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:30.740
I just got back home.
Want to come over right now?

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:36.580
Okay. Tell me where.

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:46.930
The first summer I spent with my Cub...

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:49.220
The first job I ever had in my life...

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:52.270
The faculty room at
an unfamiliar school...

00:21:52.270 --> 00:21:54.480
The rain...

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:59.020
By going between cities again and again,
my sphere of activity grew larger.

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:03.860
The world is a big place, but I've learned
that there are roads connecting it,

00:22:03.860 --> 00:22:06.410
and that I can go anywhere.

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:11.620
Now, I want to go even farther.

00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:34.890
Long time.

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:40.310
Welcome. Come on in.

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:15.970
Super Cub

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:15.970
Episode 5

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:15.970
Reiko's Summer

00:24:13.030 --> 00:24:15.950
Episode 5: "Reiko's Summer."
